            "result": "Web search results for query: \"国家医保局 智能审核规则体系 事前事中事后 审核维度\"\n\n{\n  \"query\": \"国家医保局 智能审核规则体系 事前事中事后 审核维度\",\n  \"result\": \"The National Healthcare Security Administration has established a comprehensive intelligent audit rule system covering pre-event, during-event, and post-event review dimensions. Key aspects include:\\n\\n1. Pre-event audits (事前): Focus on preventive measures and real-time monitoring of medical insurance claims before they're processed, checking for potential issues like over-prescription, misuse of insurance benefits.\\n\\n2. During-event audits (事中): Involve monitoring actual claim processing, ensuring compliance with regulations while transactions are being handled, verifying accuracy of billing and services provided.\\n\\n3. Post-event audits (事后): Conduct detailed reviews after claims are settled to identify patterns of fraud, analyze systemic issues, and refine future audit rules.\\n\\nThese dimensions collectively form a multi-layered approach to safeguarding medical insurance funds, improving efficiency, and preventing fraudulent activities.\"\n}\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
